    "revision": 1,
    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "Learning from a misunderstanding · 1",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to clarify an instruction and revise a study plan.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-13-required-interaction-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Respond to the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-13-required-interaction-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Learning from a misunderstanding · 1: A partner proposes acting immediately on the first part of this account. Explain the later information they need, ask one clarification, and negotiate a suitable next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "放学以后，我在学校看书。朋友坐在我旁边，打开笔记本，里面没有今天的练习。他以为老师没有让我们写，所以准备只看课文。\n\n我拿出课本，给他看老师让我们写的三个句子。他想起来，老师下课前说了让我们做什么，他那时候想早一点儿走，没有写下来。\n\n朋友说要回教室问老师。我说课本上有这三个句子，我也记得老师怎么说。我们先一起看课文，再把句子写在本子上。\n\n有一个句子他不明白，我和他又读了一次课文，把前面的句子放在一起看。这次他不只写三个句子，还在旁边写了明天上课要带课本和笔记本。\n\n离开学校时，朋友让我看看是不是都写好了。我看完以后把本子给他。他说下次放学前先听老师说什么，不能因为自己没有写下来，就觉得老师没说。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My reply uses the later information instead of simply repeating the first claim."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "My clarification and proposed next step address the practical constraint."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
